\subsection{Example 2}

\textbf{Input:} Provide a concise summary of the following text: 'A man was arrested after he allegedly shot and killed a woman in a parking lot in the city of San Luis Potosi, Mexico, on Wednesday.

\end{itemize}

\subsection{Dataset}

\begin{itemize}
    \item \textbf{Dataset:} The dataset is a collection of news articles from the New York Times. The dataset is divided into two parts: the training set and the test set. The training set contains 1,000 articles, and the test set contains 100 articles. The articles are divided into two categories: news and opinion. The news articles are articles that report on events that have happened in the world, while the opinion articles are articles that express the author's opinion on a particular topic.

\end{itemize}

